?{
	"info": {
		"name": "sync365 Stripe API — Supabase Edge Functions",
		"description": "Complete Postman collection for all 16 Supabase Stripe + utility edge functions with 8-rule subscription conflict matrix tests.\n\n**Base URL:** `{{SUPABASE_URL}}/functions/v1`\n\n**Auth:** Set `{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}`, `{{USER_EMAIL}}` and `{{AUTH_TOKEN}}` in your environment.\n- Admin endpoints require a valid JWT from a signed-in admin user (role check via `user_roles`).\n- User endpoints require a valid JWT (self-only via `userId` match).\n- The webhook uses Stripe's signature instead of JWT.\n- `detect-country` requires no auth.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Create a Postman environment with:\n   - `SUPABASE_URL` = `https://xftwntynzjgaedyfyxew.supabase.co`\n   - `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` = your anon key (from `.env` → `VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`)\n   - `USER_EMAIL` = your admin login email\n   - `ADMIN_PASSWORD` = your admin login password\n   - `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` = whsec_... (for local webhook testing)\n2. Run the \"🔐 Get Auth Token\" request first — it calls the `signin` edge function and auto-populates `AUTH_TOKEN`, `USER_ID`, and `USER_EMAIL`.\n3. Then run any endpoint request.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{ "key": "token", "value": "{{AUTH_TOKEN}}", "type": "string" }
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "SUPABASE_URL", "value": "https://xftwntynzjgaedyfyxew.supabase.co" },
		{ "key": "SUPABASE_ANON_KEY", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "AUTH_TOKEN", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "USER_ID", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "USER_EMAIL", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "ADMIN_PASSWORD", "value": "" },
		{ "key": "STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET", "value": "" }
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🔐 Auth Helper",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get Auth Token (email/password)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{USER_EMAIL}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{SUPABASE_URL}}/functions/v1/signin",
							"host": ["{{SUPABASE_URL}}"],
							"path": ["functions", "v1", "signin"]
						}
					},
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('AUTH_TOKEN', json.session.access_token);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('USER_ID', json.session.user.id);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('USER_EMAIL', json.session.user.email);",
									"    console.log('Token set:', json.session.access_token);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
