			"description": "8-Rule Conflict Matrix — Stripe-checkout validates these before creating a session:\n\n| # | State | Buy | Result |\n|---|-------|-----|--------|\n| 1 | No sub / Expired | Monthly or Yearly | ✅ Activates immediately |\n| 2 | Active Monthly | Monthly | ❌ ALREADY_ON_PLAN (409) |\n| 3 | Active Annual | Annual | ❌ ALREADY_ON_PLAN (409) |\n| 4 | Active Annual | Monthly | ❌ \"Higher-tier plan active\" (409) |\n| 5 | Active Monthly | Annual | ✅ Queued — starts after monthly ends |\n| 6 | Queued plan exists | Any | ❌ \"Plan already queued\" (409) |\n| 7 | Active (any) | Same plan | ❌ ALREADY_ON_PLAN (409) |\n| 8 | Cancelled (grace) | Any | ✅ Queued |"
		},
